<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Idea on 飞乐</title><link>https://www.feilewu.cn/tags/idea/</link><description>Recent content in Idea on 飞乐</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2024 19:10:53 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.feilewu.cn/tags/idea/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>IDEA搭建Scala项目-helloworld</title><link>https://www.feilewu.cn/posts/halo-posts/idea%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAscala%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE-helloworld/</link><pubDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2024 19:10:53 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.feilewu.cn/posts/halo-posts/idea%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BAscala%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE-helloworld/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="安装scala插件"&gt;安装Scala插件&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开idea的settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;进入plugins，搜索Scala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;安装&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://pic.feilewu.cn/uploads/2024/09/30/833f38d6-4e80-4a2e-90cb-b2983dd88fa6.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="安装scala-sdk"&gt;安装Scala sdk&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="官网"&gt;官网&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.scala-lang.org/download/scala2.html"&gt;https://www.scala-lang.org/download/scala2.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;根据环境自由选择&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://pic.feilewu.cn/uploads/2024/09/30/5bab8a4f-0075-4788-9aca-df28a4a801d0.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="idea自动下载"&gt;IDEA自动下载&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://pic.feilewu.cn/uploads/2024/09/30/2cd9c3d8-1be8-403a-96d3-8f93c3a69879.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;项目模块上右键，选择 add framework support，选择Scala，然后下载适当的SDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://pic.feilewu.cn/uploads/2024/09/30/a7256b53-3c98-4442-ad04-dbaabb3f93f7.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="hello-word"&gt;Hello word&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="新建scala源码目录新建scala-class类型选object"&gt;新建Scala源码目录，新建Scala class，类型选Object&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://pic.feilewu.cn/uploads/2024/09/30/84f99319-e504-44a7-a6c9-d992bcff632b.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="编写代码"&gt;编写代码&lt;/h3&gt;
